  "title": "Flutterwave and SMEDAN Partner to Drive Small Business Growth in Nigeria",
  "summary": "March 5, Lagos; Abuja, Nigeria: Flutterwave, Africa’s leading payments technology company, has announced a strategic partnership with the Small and Medium Enterprises Development Agency of Nigeria (SMEDAN) to provide micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs) across the nation with cutting-edge digital payment solutions, e-commerce tools, financial access, and capacity-building programs. This partnership marks a significant […]",
